OL,3,AArrest made after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,AEagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nazi dictator used the retreat,
OL,7,Fwhich lies above the town of
OL,8,FBerchtesgaden, as a part-time seat of
OL,9,Fgovernment and met commanders there to
OL,10,Fplan the invasion of the USSR in 1941.
